   = note: 'sample' belongs to the caller, and nothing inside 'remember' can
           prove it outlives 'arena'. Borrowing needs no thought anywhere else,
           because a borrow cannot outlive its call. Keeping one is the
           exception.
   = help: copy what you need into 'arena'
             c.latest = arena.copy(sample)
